  "content": "\n\n<p>一个用于 Scala 编写模组的库。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组包含 Scala 标准库，该库在 1.13.2 版本中已被移除。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>提供语言加载器 \"kotori_scala\"。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Scala(<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.scala-lang.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.scala-lang.org/</a>) 采用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache License, Version 2.0.</a>&nbsp;许可证授权（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.scala-lang.org%252flicense%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.scala-lang.org/license/</a>）</li>\n<li>Cats(<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftypelevel.org%252fcats%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://typelevel.org/cats/</a>) 遵循 MIT 许可证（<a href=\"https://github.com/typelevel/cats/blob/master/COPYING\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/typelevel/cats/blob/master/COPYING</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">联系方式：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ThxxGXMjZn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/ThxxGXMjZn</a></li>\n<li>GitHub：见下方</li>\n<li>Twitter：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/small_bird_316\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/small_bird_316</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>带有 “-fabric” 后缀的文件适用于 Fabric。</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>无后缀版本适用于 <strong>Minecraft Forge</strong>。</strong></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>源代码</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forge -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP</a></li>\n<li>Fabric -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP-fabric</a></li>\n</ul>",
